title: "Open Phenomena: Spatial Bubble"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Ather"
    given-names: "Syed Hussain"

abstract: >-
  An open-source scientific computing, visualization, and spatial-computing
  framework for physically grounded simulation of natural phenomena,
  beginning with soap films, thin-film optics, and capillary equilibrium
  surfaces.

